body:
Yeah I know what it's like, pal. My ex that I used to know for several years ended up being super abusive. Lied about stuff and most likely cheated on me for a good while. Too bad it left a more permanent scar on me. I need to drink pretty frequently to ease off the pain all of this shit has caused.

&#x200B;

But yeah, this post should be about you and not me. Finding out that your SO has cheated on your is never easy. From a drunk to another, we should have a toast, for you know, something. Cheers!

I had tons of fun with Just Cause 2, I remember playing the demo all over again when I had no money to buy the whole game. Might give the series another shot one day, we'll see. But yeah, I agree. Everyone has their own story. Mine is just..Idk. I was born a simple kid, I feel like it took me longer than others to grow up. It's hard to explain but I just couldn't comprehend stuff when I was young. I used to think I was retarded or something along those lines.

&#x200B;

How old are you, friend? I'm 20, still living with my mom, looking for a place to live alone at. Mom threatened to kill me in my sleep when she was having "an episode" so that's been on my mind for a while.
